UnitPriorityFeeMevTaxModule::GetMevTax
├── when the gas price is lte the base fee
│   └── it should return zero tax and false toxic
├── when the priority fee is lte the threshold
│   └── it should return zero tax and false toxic
└── when the priority fee is gt the threshold
    ├── when the computed tax does not exceed the cap
    │   ├── it should return the mev tax
    │   └── it should return true toxic
    ├── when the computed tax exceeds the cap
    │   └── it should return the cap and true toxic
    ├── when testing a concrete example
    │   └── it should return the expected tax and true toxic
    ├── when testing a rounded up example
    │   └── it should return the rounded up tax and true toxic
    ├── when testing a threshold above the minimum threshold
    │   └── it should return the expected tax and true toxic
    └── when testing a capped example
        └── it should return the cap and true toxic
